    Bug 2041889 - Ensure the table view uses the same background colors of the cards view. r=Paenglab,rtaylor

    #### How to test

    - Test both light and dark mode.
    - The background of the table view should be the same as the single card container.
    - The background of the table header should be the same as the top panel.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304931

